OL,3,GNEWSA'We're being left behind' -       
OL,4,Atourist hotspot struggles with one of  
OL,5,AUK's worst phone signals               
OL,7,FProblems accessing parking apps, making
OL,8,Fcard payments and completing phone     
OL,9,Fconversations are hampering people in  
OL,10,Fone of the UK's most popular seaside   
OL,11,Ftowns - which is also one of the       
OL,12,Fcountry's worst places for phone       
OL,13,Fsignal.                                
OL,15,FProlonged poor connectivity in Tenby   
OL,16,Fwas highlighted by the area's MP       
OL,17,Fearlier this week, who told a          
OL,18,FWestminster debate that a planned phone
OL,19,Fmast upgrade in two years' time was    
OL,20,F"not good enough".                     
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
