OL,3,GNEWSA'We're being left behind' -       
OL,4,Atourist hotspot struggles with one of  
OL,5,AUK's worst phone signals               
OL,7,FOne shopkeeper said he spent hours each
OL,8,Fweek trying to call customers back when
OL,9,Flines cut out, and that people and     
OL,10,Fbusinesses had been "left behind".     
OL,12,FThe UK government said it had "big     
OL,13,Fambitions" on connectivity and was     
OL,14,Fworking closely with industry to       
OL,15,Fdeliver them.                          
